# MeikiOCR for eval/clannad_meiki.py (the CLANNAD comparison), CPU only, run offline.
# The engine and the packages it shares with teacher/requirements.lock keep the teacher's versions
# (the env that read R1's candidates). onnx only counts the models' parameters.
# Resolved with hashes into eval/clannad_meiki_requirements.lock:
#   uv pip compile eval/clannad_meiki_requirements.in -o eval/clannad_meiki_requirements.lock \
#     --python-version 3.11 --python-platform x86_64-manylinux_2_28 --generate-hashes -c teacher/requirements.lock
